+# Version Numbering Scheme
+
+The project's current recorded decision is to use semantic versioning (semver), with releases numbered as MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH to clearly signal API compatibility changes; this supersedes an earlier decision to adopt calendar versioning (calver), which was revised in favor of semver for being a cleaner, more maintainable approach.
